# C++ Graphics Assignment - Cyan Window Close on Keypress

## Description
This assignment creates a cyan-colored graphics window using C++ `graphics.h`. The window title is set to my full name and will close when the user presses the first letter of my name ("S" for Shahanawas).

## Features
- Graphics window with cyan background
- Text message displayed on screen
- Window closes on keypress `'S'`

## Run Instructions
1. Install Turbo C++ or configure graphics.h in Code::Blocks
2. Compile and run `main.cpp`
3. Press `'S'` to exit the graphics window.

